WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:01.840
- Years ago, Alec said to me,

00:00:01.840 --> 00:00:04.510
"when I propose to you, it will be

00:00:04.510 --> 00:00:06.600
the best proposal ever."

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:10.509
(electronic music)

00:00:14.932 --> 00:00:17.400
"Back to the Future" became
a part of our relationship

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:18.630
together, probably when
you showed me like,

00:00:18.630 --> 00:00:20.513
your onesie footy pajamas.

00:00:20.513 --> 00:00:23.200
- So we enlisted the help
of our very dear friend,

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:26.660
and fantastic photographer,
Ricky Middlesworth.

00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:28.024
All we had to do was stand there,

00:00:28.024 --> 00:00:29.870
Ricky had to make it what it is.

00:00:29.870 --> 00:00:33.210
- And I just, on a wild hair,

00:00:33.210 --> 00:00:36.291
decided to post the picture to Reddit.

00:00:36.291 --> 00:00:40.083
(electronic music)

00:00:45.573 --> 00:00:48.920
- Halloween is her
favorite movie of all time.

00:00:48.920 --> 00:00:50.970
I get some of her friends to scoop her up,

00:00:50.970 --> 00:00:52.760
and tell her that they're gonna

00:00:52.760 --> 00:00:54.680
go on a walking tour of the locations

00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:57.690
and then as she's
rounding an iconic corner,

00:00:57.690 --> 00:00:59.750
Michael Myers will pop out.

00:01:01.220 --> 00:01:04.900
Okay so, here's me
waiting for Kat to come.

00:01:04.900 --> 00:01:06.280
- You must have been so nervous.

00:01:06.280 --> 00:01:08.605
- I was so nervous and I didn't realize

00:01:08.605 --> 00:01:12.410
that the mask was gonna make
it really hard for me to hear.

00:01:12.410 --> 00:01:15.030
They start chanting, which
they're doing right now.

00:01:15.030 --> 00:01:19.580
"(mumbling) well yell a little
louder, yay Haddonfield"

00:01:19.580 --> 00:01:20.430
And then I pop out.

00:01:20.430 --> 00:01:21.300
- Yay Haddonfield.

00:01:21.300 --> 00:01:23.692
(laughing)

00:01:23.692 --> 00:01:25.090
That's real.

00:01:25.090 --> 00:01:27.750
- And from here, my memory
of this, I blacked out

00:01:27.750 --> 00:01:28.920
in this moment.
- Really?

00:01:28.930 --> 00:01:30.390
- I don't remember
getting down on the knee,

00:01:30.390 --> 00:01:31.760
I remember once I was down.

00:01:31.760 --> 00:01:34.090
It was important to me to

00:01:34.090 --> 00:01:35.650
- Okay honey, stop talking.

00:01:35.650 --> 00:01:40.000
(crying)

00:01:42.740 --> 00:01:44.660
Oh look at that face.

00:01:46.870 --> 00:01:48.490
Yeah.

00:01:48.490 --> 00:01:49.950
Yeah.

00:01:49.950 --> 00:01:53.580
(soft acoustic guitar)

00:01:53.580 --> 00:01:55.190
Are you serious?

00:01:55.190 --> 00:01:56.560
Were you serious?

00:01:56.560 --> 00:01:57.990
- Yeah.

00:01:57.990 --> 00:02:01.080
(soft acoustic guitar)

00:02:01.080 --> 00:02:02.340
You can't predict what its actually

00:02:02.340 --> 00:02:05.040
gonna be like in that moment, you know?

00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:07.880
But its really special,
it's really amazing.

00:02:07.880 --> 00:02:09.540
I'm glad we have it on film.

00:02:09.540 --> 00:02:10.340
- Yeah.

00:02:10.340 --> 00:02:11.470
- And we're getting married.

00:02:11.470 --> 00:02:12.300
- I love you.

00:02:12.300 --> 00:02:13.180
- I love you.

00:02:13.180 --> 00:02:15.200
- Thank you for that.

00:02:20.480 --> 00:02:21.440
- You're my best friend.

00:02:21.440 --> 00:02:24.220
- You're my best friend.

00:02:24.220 --> 00:02:25.570
Knock me a little kiss.

00:02:25.570 --> 00:02:26.776
- Alright.

00:02:26.776 --> 00:02:27.646
- Thank you.

